    ['id' => 'offboarding', 'title' => 'Off-boarding — release of a contract', 'body' => [
      'Record the Termination event on the card › Employment periods (reason: resignation, dismissal, end of contract, retirement, mutual, other; date; documents). The portal closes the employment period, marks the person as left, deactivates a staff portal account and shows the release-of-contract checklist under the event — the Greek list (ΕΡΓΑΝΗ notice, final pay and leave compensation, insurance, equipment and keys, access revocation, exit interview …) or the Italian one for the branch. Tick the items as they are done; the HR dashboard lists the pending off-boardings until the checklist is complete. The card, its documents and its history stay; a Re-hiring event re-opens a period on the same card.',
    ]],
    ['id' => 'year', 'title' => 'The yearly cycle — 1 January checklist', 'body' => [
      ['ol' => ['Generate the public holidays of the new year for every work calendar (Settings › Work calendars › Generate) — the engine falls back to the standard list, but generating lets you add the local ones.', 'Check the leave rules against the accountant\'s circular (statutory changes) — HR settings › Leave rules.', 'Open the Entitlements of the new year: the engine computes every annual allowance; review the people with a seniority step this year (10 / 12 / 25 years) and the part-timers.', 'Carry-over: run the carry / transfer for the transferable types; confirm the figures with the accountant and lock.', 'Children born last year: enter the birth years on the cards (maternity / paternity).', 'Create the company closures of the year (Leaves › periods, Company closure) and the summer leave groups; assign the closures.', 'Publish the training plan of the year from the training-needs of the evaluations; schedule the refresher trainings for certificates expiring.', 'Export the HR report of the closed year (Planning › HR report › Excel) and file it with the accountant\'s balances.']],
    ]],
    ['id' => 'community', 'title' => 'Community tools HR owns', 'body' => [
      'Community (🤝): wishes on birthdays, name days, work anniversaries and new colleagues (the dashboard card, 14 days ahead); kudos between colleagues; the noticeboard with posts, polls and photos — HR publishes the company news and can pin a post; badges earned from the work in the portal; winner of the month — HR or the management names the winner of the previous month and the prize (Ranking › Name the winner; default prize text in Settings, key soc_prize); onboarding — HR starts the checklist of a new colleague and names a buddy; the morning nudge and the Monday digest are posted by the portal itself.',
      ['ul' => ['Company card on a celebration: write the wish from the HR account on the day — it is shown on the person\'s wishes wall with the others.', 'Keep the noticeboard alive: one post a week (a vessel delivered, a FAT passed, a newborn) keeps people coming back.', 'The winner of the month is announced to everybody — name it in the first days of the month.']],
