    ['id' => 'privacy', 'title' => 'Data protection and audit', 'body' => [
      'Personal and payroll data are visible to HR and Owner accounts only (plain administrators do not see them, nor the age on the celebrations, nor the personal columns of an import); the employee sees his own. Identification and bank numbers are masked in the change log and in the previews. Documents live outside the web root and are streamed only to the people entitled. Every change on a card is logged (card › Changes) with the user and the time. Keep the import files in the HR folder, not on shared drives; the portal never e-mails personal data. Access is removed by deactivating the account (Settings › Portal accounts) or by the Termination event.',
